# Edge Functions Directory

Create individual function directories here.

Structure:
  functions/
  ├── _shared/           # Shared utilities (already created)
  ├── my-function/       # Your function
  │   └── index.ts       # Entry point
  └── my-function-test/  # Test function
      └── index.ts

Example function:
  import { serve } from "https://deno.land/std@0.168.0/http/server.ts"
  import { withHandler, jsonResponse } from "../_shared/response.ts"

  serve(withHandler(async (req) => {
    const { name } = await req.json()
    return jsonResponse({ message: `Hello ${name}!` })
  }))

Commands:
  supabase functions serve my-function    # Test locally
  supabase functions deploy my-function   # Deploy
